WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.540
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.760
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.550
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.160
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.570
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.070
The head of the column
with the strongest knights.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.610
What've I got to worry about!

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:37.820
Rather foolish of you.

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:41.090
In a free-for-all, this would
be the most dangerous spot.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.950
The enemy would aim
at this section first.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.660
You sound pretty
sure of yourself.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.020
It's basic tactics.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.770
I see, I see.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:02.460
Forgive me!

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.700
Kashue's division is under
attack by a horde of creatures!

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.530
We need reinforcements!

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.580
What of their main force?

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:11.920
No sign.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.420
Damn you, Beld...
Using these monsters!

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.550
An army of creatures?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.060
He's using them
as battle fodder.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.680
There could be thousands,
TENS of thousands of them.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:26.880
King Kashue.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.390
Here they come again!

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.730
Keep your eyes open!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:46.450
Stand firm!
They're no better than animals!

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.460
Scowl! Shout! Threaten!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.350
Prince Jester!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.360
So, even the great mercenary king
lacks eyes in the back of his head!

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:01.030
And so, it begins.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:11.020
Is your heart galloping faster than
your horse's legs, Sir Knight?

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:17.580
Best reign it in, or it'll be of
no use to you when the time comes.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.250
My son gave this to me,
for luck.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.430
What should we do?

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:46.280
If we allow them to join up,
they'll be an even bigger threat!

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:50.530
The plan is to drive our
prey into the hunting ground.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:02.570
My lord, the prey
are almost in the trap.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.050
King Kashue!

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.130
You've come!

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.030
Yes, sire!

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.740
Fahn!

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.900
We're boxed in!

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.880
Where are they?

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:46.660
Here they come!

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:55.130
Beld!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.600
Fahn.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.910
They're behind us, too!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.220
God DAMN!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.700
We're trapped
like rats in a bag.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.700
Parn!
Get ready for them!

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.350
Parn...!

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:45.820
Go to him, Etoh.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.520
Slayn.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.010
We can't stop it now.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:54.820
Whether we're swept into the storm
or avoid it, it's all the same.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:08:00.070
Even if they manage
to win, now...

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:19.920
Lodoss will be saved by war.
Ridiculous!

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:22.910
It would seem that
Karla believes otherwise.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:25.050
However, we have our
own battle to wage.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.400
One different from
Parn's and the rest's.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.040
Damn you, witch!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:48.210
Did King Fahn give
you orders to slay me?

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:59.890
You became his enemy the minute
you sided with the Marmo!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.710
Shall I support Valis, then?

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.640
What...?!

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.130
It makes no
difference to me.

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:18.250
I must thank Fahn and Wort for
allowing me to meet my new pawns.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:21.660
Wort! Is that how
you feel about all this?!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.670
That boy may be the one.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:17.510
Princess! We've just received
word from the battlefield.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:19.800
The situation is grave.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.580
I understand.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.930
It's him.

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:38.450
IT'S HIM!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:53.540
A sword isn't a toy.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.130
WHAT?!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.130
Let me demonstrate
its proper use!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.130
Why you...!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.220
Parn!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.370
Wait.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.990
I don't need you.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:33.010
Beld!

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:41.570
Where are you?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:53.460
Surely you haven't
forgotten my face!

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.130
Come back here!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:55.980
Parn!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:04.710
The end is finally
approaching.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:26.390
Beld!

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.830
It's been a long time.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:42.550
The past is closed to us.
This is the only way left.

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:45.550
Old friend.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.890
Very well, Fahn.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:21.590
Must this be our fate,
Beld?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.840
You will
not have Lodoss!

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:28.340
I never wanted
to conquer it!

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:32.600
Unification, conquest...
It's all the same!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:44.780
Lodoss will never be
united or conquered.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:55.630
Highness!

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:58.690
Parn!
You must stop Karla.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.640
Parn!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:08.920
Wort...?

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:16.260
Even if this war ends...

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:21.150
Lodoss will never know peace
as long as she still lives.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.180
What do you mean?

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:29.360
Karla believes this is in
Lodoss' best interests, but now...

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:33.370
You're saying if we kill Karla,
we'll stop this war?

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:40.870
That I cannot say for certain.
But the tragedy to come.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.380
"Tragedy?"
What do you mean?

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:48.670
Karla doesn't consider herself
a mere human anymore.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:56.450
Living these last 500
years has unbalanced her.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:16:00.460
If we allow her meddling
to continue unchecked...

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:05.180
Lodoss could face
even greater disasters.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.900
To prevent this...

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:20.330
Remove the circlet from her
forehead. That is her true self.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.830
Parn, what's wrong?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.340
Why did Wort...?

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:56.030
Age hasn't changed us much.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:01.500
I'll live long enough
to see you dead!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.000
My feelings exactly.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.000
Sire!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:15.210
Lodoss can be neither
conquered nor united!

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.100
Everyone! Get under cover
before you're blown away!

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:57.980
Sire.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.970
Wait, we can't just...

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.950
The dead return
to the soil of Lodoss.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.910
Such is the fate of knights.

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:16.580
Such is the way of war.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.990
The nameless are like dust.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:28.600
No one shall come to lay
flowers by their grave.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:33.290
Only those who earned their
names are ever remembered.

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:55.960
My son gave me this,
for luck.

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:03.160
Parn.

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:09.230
This isn't right.
It isn't right!

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:11.970
You must stop Karla.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:18.980
Or else Lodoss may face
an even worse disaster!

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:30.520
A war without meaning.
A war which saved no one.

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:34.860
But now, still another
battle must be fought.

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:38.860
As he stood amidst
a sea of bodies...

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:43.770
the young man vowed to
challenge the witch, Karla.

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:58.560
Leaving the wilderness of battle
behind, we turn to confront Karla.

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:02.690
Can even Ghim's determined calls be
enough to awaken Leylia's heart...

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.760
in the face of sorcery whose
power is beyond imagination?

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:07.740
Next time, on
Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:10.970
Episode 8 - "Requiem for Warriors"

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.080
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
